StatAverageTraveledDistance [SimTalk] - WorkerPool
Returns the average distance in meters which the Worker traveled from the WorkerPool designated by
<Path> to the Workplaces attached to the stations and between the stations.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.StatAverageTraveledDistance → length
Return Value
The return value has the data type length.
Example
print MyWorkerPool.StatAverageTraveledDistance
